                        betalningshanteringen direkt.
                    </p>

                    <div class="row mb-3">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label for="lateTeamRegionSelect" class="form-label fw-bold">Krets</label>
                            <select class="form-select" id="lateTeamRegionSelect">
                                <option value="">Alla kretsar</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label for="lateTeamClubSelect" class="form-label fw-bold">Förening</label>
